# Font files are binary: never convert line endings in them (the app bundles TrueType fonts, 2.1.001).
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
# The container build files are shell-adjacent and read by Linux tooling: keep them LF on every checkout (GR-420).
# They are not in the bundled-data manifest (data/bundled.sha256), so this does not change any recorded hash.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
